{"title":"회귀의 전설","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=dTDkPQ/hAd42vnoNw/pQamsvgjoU1rHvSQs5BrD1&filename=th3","synopsis":"제2의 IMF 같은 상황으로 인해 다니던 증권 회사가 망해버리고 장태산은 노량진을 떠도는 백수 신세로 전락하고 만다.\n차에 치일 뻔한 초등학생을 구하다가 목숨을 잃지만 목숨과 맞바꾼 선업 덕분에 무려 14년 전인 과거에서 회귀하며 새로운 삶을 맞이한다. \n\n살아났다는 기쁨도 잠시, 또다시 수능을 치러야 한다는 생각에 머리가 지끈거리는데…\n수능 문제도 모자라 사시 공부 때 접했던 사법 시험, 증권맨으로 재직했을 당시 봐왔던 주식 시장 그래프까지 머릿속에 생생하게 그려진다…?!\n\n지난번 생은 망했지만 회귀한 생은 오직 성공뿐이다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":56,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":48,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":54,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":51,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":41,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":51,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":55,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":57,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":67,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":71,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":62,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":46,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":57,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":55,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":55,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":52,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":47,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":60,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":59,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":58,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":56,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":56,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31"